# The released images this repository depends on, and nothing else (viafrei-web#2).
# One line per pin: <key> <image>:<X.Y.Z>@sha256:<digest>. The digest is what is
# pulled; the version tag is what a reader sees, and `scripts/pins.sh check` holds
# the two equal against the registry. A bump is a one-line change here.
#
#   digest    the viafrei-app image whose digest service renders the fragments the
#             shell embeds (/internal/…): the e2e harness runs its compiled digest,
#             ingest and mcp packages (scripts/pinned-app.sh), and the integration
#             run starts its digest service (scripts/stack.sh). It is the image
#             prod's digest Deployment runs (read 2026-11-15).
#   database  the viafrei-database release that migrates the digest's database in
#             the integration run (scripts/test-db.sh). Schema head 293; the digest
#             of viafrei-app 2.6.17 reads relations up to migration 0292.
digest ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-app:2.6.17@sha256:296b406ade0fa4139e07494ecbb23397fc6a26335eb42559605da10c9aa9f6d7
database ghcr.io/mavrovde/viafrei-database:0.1.1@sha256:30552ff96cbcd2e2a1facb0314717e46ca2cbd20f21f08662ec9c081eb40ce50
